WEBVTT

00:00:03.253 --> 00:00:06.256
Choose your file with the file picker.

00:00:06.256 --> 00:00:10.283
This one is a list of customers, saved as a CSV file.

00:00:10.772 --> 00:00:16.425
Publish imported content is ticked, so every item is published as soon as it is imported.

00:00:16.425 --> 00:00:20.472
Untick it to save each item as a draft that you publish later.

00:00:20.999 --> 00:00:22.234
Click Upload.

00:00:22.234 --> 00:00:27.957
A progress bar shows the upload, and a large file is sent in pieces automatically.

00:00:27.957 --> 00:00:30.429
Then the Bulk Import page opens.

